### Payroll calculations
First calculate attendance-adjusted salary using the existing payroll logic and configured attendance policy.

Then calculate:

Payable = Attendance-adjusted salary
- Advances
- Employee ESI
- Employee PF
- Actual posted loan deduction

Important:

