- Deduct only the installment applicable to the selected payroll month.
- Cap the deduction at the actual outstanding balance.
- A skipped installment must contribute ₹0 to the deduction.
- A paused or completed loan must not generate a deduction.
- Do not deduct anything before the start month.
- Do not automatically deduct arrears from later months.
- Prevent duplicate deductions if payroll is retried.
- Follow the existing authorization and payroll finalization workflow.

